# A Killer Among Us: "When this enchantment enters, create a 1/1 white Human, 1/1 blue Merfolk and 1/1 red Goblin creature
# token. Then secretly choose Human, Merfolk, or Goblin." The three tokens are made, then Bot1 chooses Goblin in secret:
# the choice is kept with the enchantment and with Bot1 as the player who chose it (CR 607.2d); Bot2 is shown no type.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
A Killer Among Us
Forest x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.A Killer Among Us.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Modes(Goblin)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Human Token.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Human Token.Toughness = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Human Token.Colors = White
Bot1.Battlefield.Merfolk Token.Colors = Blue
Bot1.Battlefield.Goblin Token.Colors = Red
Bot1.Battlefield.A Killer Among Us.SecretSubtype = Goblin
Bot1.Battlefield.A Killer Among Us.SecretSubtypeChooser = Bot1
Bot1.Battlefield.Human Token.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Merfolk Token.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Goblin Token.Tapped = false
